WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:16.264
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:16.534 --> 00:22.869
(Firefly Theater)

3
00:43.456 --> 00:47.392
♪Neon lights twist into a knot♪

4
00:49.024 --> 00:52.608
♪I rest in the ruins of defeat♪

5
00:53.184 --> 00:55.520
♪You tap your fingers lightly♪

6
00:55.904 --> 00:58.656
♪I fall into the abyss♪

7
00:59.488 --> 01:02.080
♪I've seen this game before♪

8
01:02.080 --> 01:04.768
♪Every single move was calculated♪

9
01:04.768 --> 01:07.168
♪I finally see your silhouette♪

10
01:07.552 --> 01:10.304
♪Just an empty shell♪

11
01:10.624 --> 01:13.440
♪I've broken this game before♪

12
01:13.440 --> 01:15.872
♪Every move was placed wrong♪

13
01:15.872 --> 01:18.016
♪Now it's my turn to play♪

14
01:18.208 --> 01:25.056
♪I'll show you what stunning looks like♪

15
01:25.728 --> 01:28.256
♪When I stand back up again♪

16
01:28.544 --> 01:30.400
♪The whole city goes dark♪

17
01:31.264 --> 01:33.952
♪For the part you owe me♪

18
01:34.112 --> 01:41.088
♪I'll make you pay double♪

19
01:42.624 --> 01:47.360
♪You're just my starting point♪

20
01:51.712 --> 01:52.739
=The Vanishing Beauty=

21
01:53.000 --> 01:55.720
=Episode 14=

22
02:08.739 --> 02:09.580
Ms. Hui?

23
02:14.820 --> 02:15.580
Ms. Hui,

24
02:15.860 --> 02:16.700
take it easy.

25
02:16.899 --> 02:18.100
My car didn't come cheap.

26
02:19.059 --> 02:19.820
I can afford it.

27
02:22.059 --> 02:23.140
Why are you here?

28
02:23.540 --> 02:24.339
Just passing by.

29
02:24.459 --> 02:25.140
Passing by?

30
02:27.020 --> 02:28.499
That was quite a close call.

31
02:28.700 --> 02:29.619
But seriously,

32
02:29.779 --> 02:30.779
drive safe from now on.

33
02:31.700 --> 02:32.580
The car

34
02:32.580 --> 02:33.459
we got you

35
02:33.499 --> 02:34.380
has decent specs,

36
02:34.779 --> 02:35.779
but it's nowhere

37
02:36.339 --> 02:37.580
near mine.

38
02:37.980 --> 02:39.540
If there's an actual crash,

39
02:40.260 --> 02:41.864
who do you think will survive?

40
02:46.380 --> 02:47.459
The brakes suddenly failed.

41
02:48.700 --> 02:49.939
I'll drop it off at the dealer.

42
03:14.700 --> 03:15.339
How are you?

43
03:15.700 --> 03:16.899
Let's get you checked out.

44
03:17.540 --> 03:18.659
Don't worry. I'm fine.

45
03:18.899 --> 03:19.624
We didn't crash.

46
03:23.540 --> 03:24.659
Lu Hui is usually so calm,

47
03:24.739 --> 03:25.300
yet she acted

48
03:25.300 --> 03:26.260
so rashly for Harry.

49
03:26.860 --> 03:27.580
Exactly.

50
03:28.179 --> 03:30.420
Harry must be her weak spot.

51
03:32.140 --> 03:33.020
I'm heading back.

52
03:33.339 --> 03:34.140
I need to sort out

53
03:34.179 --> 03:35.059
the forum thing fast.

54
03:36.059 --> 03:36.540
Watch out!

55
03:55.059 --> 03:56.420
What's wrong with you?

56
03:57.020 --> 03:58.700
Starving, or did you overeat?

57
03:59.420 --> 04:00.059
It's nothing.

58
04:00.939 --> 04:03.059
I hiccup when I get nervous.

59
04:04.580 --> 04:05.779
Hiccups when nervous?

60
04:07.059 --> 04:07.619
It's nothing.

61
04:08.300 --> 04:09.260
Really, it's nothing.

62
04:09.380 --> 04:10.179
Go on upstairs

63
04:10.260 --> 04:11.339
and get some warm water.

64
04:11.499 --> 04:12.499
I'll head back now.

65
04:25.820 --> 04:27.140
Mom, you're back.

66
04:35.700 --> 04:36.620
You made all this?

67
04:36.899 --> 04:37.820
Studying abroad

68
04:37.940 --> 04:39.580
turns every student into a chef.

69
04:39.979 --> 04:41.339
I even practiced beforehand

70
04:41.380 --> 04:42.060
and made Dad

71
04:42.099 --> 04:43.060
pork and egg congee.

72
04:43.060 --> 04:43.912
Let me get you some.

73
04:45.099 --> 04:46.339
Don't think

74
04:46.339 --> 04:47.979
this excuses what you did.

75
04:49.099 --> 04:50.459
Getting into fights now?

76
04:51.500 --> 04:52.580
And over a woman?

77
04:53.219 --> 04:54.099
You know that too?

78
04:54.380 --> 04:55.459
What do you know about her

79
04:55.620 --> 04:56.459
or her family?

80
04:56.899 --> 04:58.248
And you stepped up for her?

81
04:59.140 --> 05:00.339
Why should I care?

82
05:00.539 --> 05:02.659
All I know is she's a good person.

83
05:02.859 --> 05:03.459
That's enough.

84
05:03.740 --> 05:04.899
So you know nothing

85
05:05.459 --> 05:06.459
about her background?

86
05:07.419 --> 05:08.339
Not entirely.

87
05:08.539 --> 05:09.700
I know her name

88
05:10.180 --> 05:11.060
and her address.

89
05:11.140 --> 05:12.260
Have you met her husband?

90
05:12.419 --> 05:12.940
No.

91
05:13.099 --> 05:13.979
I hit it off with her,

92
05:13.979 --> 05:14.940
not her husband.

93
05:15.299 --> 05:16.380
Why ask so many questions?

94
05:16.419 --> 05:17.459
Hit it off?

95
05:18.260 --> 05:19.500
You said she's married.

96
05:19.700 --> 05:20.820
Her husband can handle it.

97
05:21.339 --> 05:22.180
Why should you care?

98
05:22.419 --> 05:23.380
Her husband is useless.

99
05:23.459 --> 05:24.659
So I helped out. What's wrong?

100
05:24.779 --> 05:25.459
Helped out?

101
05:26.459 --> 05:27.099
So many

102
05:27.180 --> 05:28.020
pretty young girls

103
05:28.099 --> 05:28.659
out there,

104
05:28.859 --> 05:29.419
and you're

105
05:29.419 --> 05:30.580
chasing after an old woman.

106
05:30.700 --> 05:31.940
Don't call her that!

107
05:32.099 --> 05:32.539
Mom,

108
05:32.779 --> 05:33.940
watch your words.

109
05:34.099 --> 05:35.419
My son takes a stranger's side.

110
05:35.740 --> 05:36.620
Why would I be nice?

111
05:36.820 --> 05:37.500
Do you like her?

112
05:37.779 --> 05:38.859
What are you talking about?

113
05:39.020 --> 05:40.180
Calm down!

114
05:41.060 --> 05:42.140
She's over 12 years older!

115
05:42.219 --> 05:43.380
Are you driving me crazy?

116
05:47.339 --> 05:47.859
Mom,

117
05:47.940 --> 05:49.260
don't be so mad.

118
05:51.219 --> 05:51.820
Please sit.

119
05:51.979 --> 05:52.580
Come on.

120
05:53.500 --> 05:54.580
Calm down.

121
05:57.260 --> 05:57.979
Mom,

122
05:58.219 --> 05:59.500
what are you, Cupid?

123
05:59.700 --> 06:00.260
Just because

124
06:00.500 --> 06:01.380
I get close

125
06:01.419 --> 06:02.140
to a woman,

126
06:02.419 --> 06:03.539
it means I like her?

127
06:06.659 --> 06:07.339
Fine.

128
06:09.539 --> 06:10.459
I admit I was

129
06:11.380 --> 06:12.620
a bit worked up just now.

130
06:13.940 --> 06:14.620
I apologize.

131
06:14.979 --> 06:15.459
But I really

132
06:15.500 --> 06:16.539
can't help worrying.

133
06:18.020 --> 06:19.419
So the best thing to do

134
06:21.940 --> 06:22.979
is stop seeing her.

135
06:23.740 --> 06:24.659
Why should I?

136
06:27.899 --> 06:28.899
Because I'm your mother.

137
06:29.820 --> 06:31.020
Because I care about you.

138
06:32.779 --> 06:34.299
You need to understand boundaries.

139
06:35.260 --> 06:36.700
Don't make things awkward for her.

140
06:37.339 --> 06:38.020
I don't agree.

141
06:38.979 --> 06:40.140
You're controlling my life.

142
06:42.020 --> 06:42.500
Fine.

143
06:44.700 --> 06:46.060
If you see her again,

144
06:47.339 --> 06:48.500
don't come back to see me.

145
06:49.659 --> 06:50.219
Wait,

146
06:50.459 --> 06:51.020
Mom.

147
06:51.500 --> 06:52.140
I don't know

148
06:52.140 --> 06:53.099
why you're so agitated!

149
06:53.099 --> 06:53.659
I already said

150
06:53.659 --> 06:54.380
there's nothing!

151
06:54.380 --> 06:55.419
We're just friends!

152
07:00.620 --> 07:01.659
I fear you'll go astray.

153
07:02.620 --> 07:04.020
You must listen to me on this.

154
07:13.721 --> 07:15.803
(Ren)

155
07:27.620 --> 07:28.580
What's wrong with Haoyu?

156
07:31.180 --> 07:32.339
He knows he was wrong.

157
07:33.260 --> 07:34.380
It's all sorted out.

158
07:36.099 --> 07:37.260
Don't get so worked up.

159
07:38.700 --> 07:39.740
Try the century egg congee

160
07:40.060 --> 07:41.779
he made for you.

161
07:42.099 --> 07:43.180
It's just a bit cold.

162
07:45.659 --> 07:46.299
Neither of you

163
07:46.299 --> 07:47.700
gives me peace of mind.

164
07:48.740 --> 07:49.539
How are things

165
07:49.620 --> 07:50.500
at the company?

166
07:52.979 --> 07:54.500
It's fine. Why?

167
07:56.180 --> 07:57.140
I doubt that.

168
07:57.620 --> 07:58.620
Didn't Yu Meng

169
07:59.140 --> 08:00.859
take away the signing authority?

170
08:01.539 --> 08:02.500
How did you know?

171
08:03.740 --> 08:04.940
You kept it from me,

172
08:05.979 --> 08:06.580
yet expected me

173
08:06.659 --> 08:08.299
to pay six million to smooth things over.

174
08:12.500 --> 08:13.260
Don't worry.

175
08:14.859 --> 08:16.060
Even if she got it,

176
08:16.140 --> 08:16.899
what can she do?

177
08:17.580 --> 08:18.820
I used Chen Chen's matter

178
08:19.779 --> 08:21.099
to make Mr. Tian see her audit

179
08:21.620 --> 08:23.140
as nothing but jealousy

180
08:23.419 --> 08:24.180
and power abuse.

181
08:24.500 --> 08:25.979
Mr. Tian is displeased with her now.

182
08:26.419 --> 08:27.380
He'll address it openly

183
08:27.659 --> 08:28.779
at tomorrow's meeting.

184
08:29.020 --> 08:30.020
Her victory won't last.

185
08:30.899 --> 08:32.100
We'll be the winners.

186
08:32.299 --> 08:33.380
After saying all this,

187
08:34.699 --> 08:35.659
you just don't want

188
08:35.779 --> 08:36.579
to leave Jiali,

189
08:37.179 --> 08:37.779
right?

190
08:39.299 --> 08:40.020
Why?

191
08:41.819 --> 08:42.740
Because I want Jiali.

192
08:44.659 --> 08:45.740
Lately, there have been

193
08:46.100 --> 08:47.340
many rumors around the company.

194
08:47.980 --> 08:49.819
I even heard an employee

195
08:50.380 --> 08:52.179
posted under their real name on the forum,

196
08:52.340 --> 08:53.260
claiming Jinghua

197
08:53.260 --> 08:54.699
has no issues at all,

198
08:54.740 --> 08:56.380
and the so-called audit

199
08:56.500 --> 08:58.140
is nothing but a ridiculous farce.

200
08:58.260 --> 08:59.740
The post is trending now.

201
08:59.939 --> 09:01.299
Everyone is deeply upset,

202
09:01.539 --> 09:02.620
slacking off in protest.

203
09:02.699 --> 09:03.779
That's just the poster's

204
09:03.779 --> 09:04.939
one-sided story.

205
09:05.419 --> 09:06.779
Speaking of one-sided,

206
09:07.059 --> 09:07.860
you're the only one

207
09:08.100 --> 09:09.220
who's been

208
09:09.220 --> 09:10.140
pushing this forward.

209
09:10.620 --> 09:11.659
Are you using this audit

210
09:11.740 --> 09:13.100
as an excuse

211
09:13.460 --> 09:15.140
to vent your personal feelings?

212
09:15.380 --> 09:15.939
Mr. Tian,

213
09:16.539 --> 09:17.980
my father asked for this audit.

214
09:18.299 --> 09:19.779
No personal feelings involved.

215
09:20.340 --> 09:21.179
I know Meng.

216
09:21.299 --> 09:22.179
She's never vague

217
09:22.419 --> 09:23.340
on important issues.

218
09:23.380 --> 09:24.500
Don't defend her

219
09:24.579 --> 09:25.579
just because

220
09:25.659 --> 09:26.779
she's your wife.

221
09:27.059 --> 09:27.779
The company

222
09:28.260 --> 09:29.260
follows protocol.

223
09:29.299 --> 09:30.620
Why are you so convinced

224
09:30.779 --> 09:31.659
that the audit

225
09:31.819 --> 09:32.899
is just me settling

226
09:33.020 --> 09:33.699
a personal score?

227
09:34.140 --> 09:35.340
I want to believe you,

228
09:35.779 --> 09:36.140
but

229
09:36.260 --> 09:37.899
knowing Yu,

230
09:38.220 --> 09:39.779
rushing an audit like this

231
09:39.899 --> 09:41.299
isn't his style.

232
09:41.419 --> 09:42.179
It has disrupted

233
09:42.260 --> 09:43.380
our company's projects.

234
09:43.620 --> 09:44.380
So I propose

235
09:44.899 --> 09:46.980
we vote to end the Jinghua audit,

236
09:47.299 --> 09:48.779
and get our operations back on track

237
09:48.779 --> 09:50.100
as soon as possible.

238
09:50.260 --> 09:51.299
Process payments

239
09:51.500 --> 09:52.340
immediately.

240
09:52.620 --> 09:53.659
Let's stop this nonsense.

241
09:53.819 --> 09:54.419
I agree.

242
09:54.579 --> 09:55.620
- Agreed. - Agreed.

243
09:55.860 --> 09:56.419
No.

244
09:56.699 --> 09:57.768
We can stop the audit.

245
09:57.980 --> 09:59.380
What proof do you have

246
09:59.579 --> 10:01.020
that this audit

247
10:01.100 --> 10:02.140
wasn't my father's idea?

248
10:02.380 --> 10:03.779
And what proof do you have

249
10:04.059 --> 10:05.659
that it was his idea?

250
10:05.980 --> 10:07.140
- Exactly. - How do you prove it?

251
10:07.260 --> 10:08.419
We know Yu very well.

252
10:08.579 --> 10:09.620
I am the proof.

253
10:13.620 --> 10:14.460
Here's the thing.

254
10:14.460 --> 10:16.020
Before Chairman Yu fell into a coma,

255
10:16.100 --> 10:17.299
he brought up Jinghua

256
10:17.419 --> 10:19.140
and mentioned an audit several times.

257
10:19.620 --> 10:21.299
As the company's CFO,

258
10:21.419 --> 10:22.779
and having worked under him

259
10:22.939 --> 10:24.419
for over 40 years,

260
10:24.980 --> 10:26.140
I can stand by

261
10:26.260 --> 10:26.939
what I said.

262
10:27.299 --> 10:28.340
So it seems

263
10:29.100 --> 10:30.500
I really did misunderstand Meng.

264
10:30.860 --> 10:31.939
I apologize, Meng.

265
10:34.020 --> 10:34.860
It's fine, Mr. Tian.

266
10:35.659 --> 10:37.020
You only did it for the company.

267
10:37.380 --> 10:38.140
Tian

268
10:38.460 --> 10:40.179
was just being professional.

269
10:40.539 --> 10:42.460
He was just worried the project

270
10:42.659 --> 10:44.260
would get delayed by the audit,

271
10:44.340 --> 10:46.340
hurting our daily operations.

272
10:46.539 --> 10:47.059
Yeah.

273
10:47.299 --> 10:48.899
How about this, everyone?

274
10:49.460 --> 10:50.539
Let's set a time limit

275
10:50.539 --> 10:51.500
on the audit.

276
10:52.020 --> 10:52.899
Within one week,

277
10:53.340 --> 10:54.579
we must have the results.

278
10:54.980 --> 10:55.460
I agree.

279
10:55.579 --> 10:56.179
Agreed.

280
10:56.419 --> 10:57.100
I agree.

281
10:58.380 --> 10:59.100
I also agree.

282
10:59.740 --> 11:00.980
Meng, what do you think?

283
11:01.419 --> 11:02.939
Meng and I both agree.

284
11:05.899 --> 11:07.899
With you backing Meng,

285
11:08.179 --> 11:09.260
that's wonderful.

286
11:10.939 --> 11:11.419
By the way,

287
11:11.939 --> 11:13.340
I have one more point.

288
11:13.620 --> 11:14.500
Given the damage

289
11:14.539 --> 11:15.179
this post

290
11:15.260 --> 11:16.500
has had internally,

291
11:16.779 --> 11:18.179
I think the poster should face

292
11:18.260 --> 11:19.400
serious consequences.

293
11:19.500 --> 11:20.500
What should we do?

294
11:20.819 --> 11:21.740
By company policy,

295
11:22.100 --> 11:22.620
fire them.

296
11:29.980 --> 11:30.939
Firing me only shows

297
11:30.980 --> 11:32.179
an admission of her guilt.

298
11:39.380 --> 11:40.020
Chen Chen,

299
11:41.980 --> 11:43.539
I saw your post.

300
11:43.899 --> 11:45.179
I think some things

301
11:45.500 --> 11:46.500
are better explained

302
11:46.579 --> 11:47.220
in person.

303
11:47.659 --> 11:48.380
You said I suspect

304
11:48.380 --> 11:50.059
there's something between you and Mr. Di.

305
11:50.380 --> 11:51.179
Then let me ask you.

306
11:51.939 --> 11:52.699
If I really thought

307
11:52.699 --> 11:53.460
there was something

308
11:53.460 --> 11:54.179
between you two,

309
11:54.340 --> 11:55.899
would I have kept you by his side

310
11:55.980 --> 11:57.299
as his secretary for so long?

311
11:57.299 --> 11:58.860
What if you kept me around on purpose

312
11:59.140 --> 12:00.380
to catch dirt on us?

313
12:00.659 --> 12:01.819
There would have to be dirt

314
12:01.819 --> 12:02.500
to catch first.

315
12:13.179 --> 12:13.819
Mr. Di,

316
12:14.419 --> 12:15.460
have I ever

317
12:15.579 --> 12:16.460
been unreasonable

318
12:16.740 --> 12:17.740
or picked on Chen Chen?

319
12:20.899 --> 12:21.419
No.

320
12:22.059 --> 12:23.020
You've been supportive.

321
12:25.699 --> 12:26.179
You see?

322
12:26.939 --> 12:28.059
You're overthinking it.

323
12:28.340 --> 12:28.980
I hope you'll

324
12:29.020 --> 12:29.980
watch your words

325
12:30.260 --> 12:31.539
and actions in your new role.

326
12:33.020 --> 12:34.020
Best of luck to you.

327
12:34.659 --> 12:35.460
Take care.

328
12:46.340 --> 12:46.860
All right,

329
12:47.179 --> 12:48.899
that's the end of this matter.

330
12:49.179 --> 12:50.419
Now, I'd like to address

331
12:50.620 --> 12:51.539
your concerns.

332
12:51.980 --> 12:53.500
The recent audit

333
12:53.819 --> 12:54.980
delayed progress on Jinghua,

334
12:55.100 --> 12:55.980
but I want to say

335
12:56.340 --> 12:57.779
that your bonuses and incentives

336
12:58.020 --> 12:58.899
will be paid in full.

337
12:59.579 --> 13:00.659
If the company falls short,

338
13:00.980 --> 13:01.939
I'll pay it myself.

339
13:03.539 --> 13:04.539
The bonus paperwork

340
13:04.620 --> 13:05.419
has been drafted.

341
13:05.539 --> 13:07.140
Once signed, it goes straight to HR.

342
13:07.980 --> 13:08.860
Rest assured.

343
13:08.939 --> 13:09.699
I will never

344
13:09.740 --> 13:10.579
shortchange you.

345
13:11.500 --> 13:12.539
You're the best, Miss Yu!

346
13:12.779 --> 13:13.980
Thanks, Meng!

347
13:19.460 --> 13:20.699
So before leaving today,

348
13:20.980 --> 13:21.939
can the auditors

349
