731
26:19.339 --> 26:20.220
But

732
26:20.379 --> 26:21.900
Jinghua hasn't launched yet.

733
26:22.460 --> 26:24.220
The samples are all at Han Guang's factory.

734
26:24.379 --> 26:25.420
How can we

735
26:25.460 --> 26:26.420
