773
28:27.420 --> 28:27.940
How is it?

774
28:28.339 --> 28:28.940
Great.

775
28:29.980 --> 28:31.176
The hair right here...

776
28:31.619 --> 28:32.220
Okay.

777
28:37.500 --> 28:38.339
Mr. Di, could you

778
28:38.379 --> 28:39.260
