800
29:14.980 --> 29:15.740
Hi, everyone.

801
29:15.940 --> 29:16.980
I'm Di Liren.

802
29:17.660 --> 29:18.139
Bai,

803
29:19.260 --> 29:19.980
this guy...

804
29:20.460 --> 29:21.339
He's Meng's husband.

805
29:23.579 --> 29:24.740
