818
29:51.980 --> 29:52.460
Bai,

819
29:53.260 --> 29:54.099
how long has Mr. Di

820
29:54.700 --> 29:55.779
been with Meng?

821
29:57.139 --> 29:57.940
About five years.

822
29:58.339 --> 29:59.260
All on her profile.

823
29:59.460 --> 30:00.392
Take a look yourself.

824
30:02.220 --> 30:03.579
Our new product, Jinghua,

825
30:03.660 --> 30:04.740
