830
30:13.139 --> 30:13.700
I'll do it.

831
30:15.260 --> 30:16.059
Let him.

832
30:16.220 --> 30:17.980
If things go south, mute and cut the feed.

833
30:18.379 --> 30:19.859
Still praising your looks, Honey.

834
30:31.940 --> 30:32.539
(Liu Zi?)

835
30:32.619 --> 30:33.608
(What's going on?)

836
30:37.740 --> 30:38.740
