845
30:55.579 --> 30:57.460
I'm nice

846
30:57.500 --> 30:58.379
to all the fans

847
30:58.940 --> 30:59.740
in this livestream

848
30:59.740 --> 31:01.420
and all the consumers

849
31:01.940 --> 31:02.460
of Jiali.

850
31:03.220 --> 31:04.819
Everyone, start asking for samples now.

851
31:05.180 --> 31:05.992
