852
31:06.379 --> 31:08.020
(- Give us Jinghua! - Samples!)

853
31:08.020 --> 31:08.940
Don't worry, everyone.

854
31:09.020 --> 31:10.339
There will be perks for our fans!

855
31:10.539 --> 31:11.220
Type 1!

856
31:11.260 --> 31:12.940
Let's draw lucky viewers!

857
31:13.139 --> 31:13.859
Let me see

858
31:13.859 --> 31:14.940
how many of you

859
31:14.980 --> 31:16.099
