860
31:17.779 --> 31:17.980
Okay.

861
31:18.020 --> 31:18.779
Our second question

862
31:18.779 --> 31:19.816
is also for Mr. Di.

863
31:20.020 --> 31:21.579
What's more important

864
31:21.859 --> 31:23.059
for a family,

865
31:23.579 --> 31:24.420
money or time?

866
31:25.099 --> 31:26.539
Trust is surely more important.

867
31:27.220 --> 31:28.619
Through its reputation,

868
31:28.619 --> 31:29.379
Jiali has earned

869
31:29.700 --> 31:30.139
the trust

870
31:30.139 --> 31:31.299
of our consumers.

871
31:32.059 --> 31:33.460
We will continue to guarantee

872
31:33.460 --> 31:34.099
product quality.

873
31:35.420 --> 31:36.299
We also hope

874
31:36.299 --> 31:37.059
all our fans

875
31:37.539 --> 31:38.819
won't believe or spread rumors.

876
31:38.980 --> 31:40.099
Stay tuned for our new drop,

877
31:40.299 --> 31:40.779
Jinghua.

878
31:41.020 --> 31:42.139
Stay tuned for our new drop,

879
31:42.339 --> 31:42.819
Jinghua.

880
31:43.500 --> 31:44.379
It turns out

881
31:44.420 --> 31:45.220
so many fans

882
31:45.299 --> 31:46.660
