883
31:47.260 --> 31:47.660
Okay.

884
31:47.819 --> 31:48.579
Let's do this then.

885
31:48.980 --> 31:49.940
We'll pick

886
31:49.980 --> 31:50.980
our luckiest viewers.

887
31:51.299 --> 31:52.740
Representing Jiali, we'll

888
31:52.819 --> 31:54.539
