893
32:02.299 --> 32:03.260
(We want fan perks!)

894
32:03.779 --> 32:05.539
(- Give us Jinghua! - Come on, Mr. Di!)

895
32:05.539 --> 32:06.099
Honey,

896
32:06.779 --> 32:07.660
didn't you just agree

897
32:07.700 --> 32:09.059
to give perks to our fans?

898
32:09.420 --> 32:10.819
That's why I promised them.

899
32:11.579 --> 32:13.020
Now they've all heard it,

900
32:13.059 --> 32:14.660
and they all want Jinghua samples.

901
32:14.700 --> 32:15.779
Right, guys?

902
32:16.339 --> 32:18.059
Just make an exception, Honey.

903
32:18.139 --> 32:19.059
Just send them

904
32:19.099 --> 32:20.139
