905
32:20.299 --> 32:21.299
Don't embarrass me.

906
32:21.819 --> 32:22.900
Just give out some.

907
32:23.139 --> 32:24.020
Only a few, then.

908
32:24.579 --> 32:26.339
Hurry, everyone is watching.

909
32:29.740 --> 32:30.420
All right.

910
32:30.579 --> 32:31.400
We'll do that.

911
32:32.059 --> 32:32.579
However,

912
32:33.180 --> 32:33.980
only ten sets.

913
32:35.619 --> 32:37.099
My hands are tied too,

914
32:37.940 --> 32:39.020
so please understand.

915
32:40.420 --> 32:41.740
Let's all thank Mr. Di!

916
32:42.059 --> 32:43.460
Backstage, get ready

917
32:43.619 --> 32:44.940
