922
33:05.059 --> 33:05.339
You...

923
33:05.660 --> 33:06.504
Come with me.

924
33:10.859 --> 33:11.819
What are you doing here?

925
33:12.059 --> 33:12.579
When did you

926
33:12.579 --> 33:13.299
meet Yu Meng?

927
33:13.379 --> 33:13.900
And you?

928
33:14.579 --> 33:15.579
Did you cheat on Mom?

929
33:15.859 --> 33:17.020
Why pretend not to know me?

930
33:17.460 --> 33:18.220
And since when

931
33:19.260 --> 33:20.099
are you Di Liren?

932
33:20.500 --> 33:21.779
Calm down, will you?

933
33:22.779 --> 33:23.700
I'll explain everything

934
33:23.740 --> 33:24.579
you want to know

935
33:24.619 --> 33:25.260
once we're home.

936
33:25.299 --> 33:26.339
You don't even come home!

937
33:28.980 --> 33:29.579
Does Meng know

938
33:29.619 --> 33:30.539
you have a son?

939
33:32.099 --> 33:32.740
Not talking?

940
33:33.940 --> 33:35.208
In that case, I'll go tell her!

941
33:35.460 --> 33:35.819
Wait!

942
33:44.539 --> 33:45.660
Your mom and I are divorced.

943
33:47.700 --> 33:48.940
Yu Meng knows nothing.

944
33:49.379 --> 33:50.460
Stay away from them.

945
33:50.619 --> 33:51.819
Stop hanging around with them.

946
33:53.619 --> 33:54.579
I'll explain everything

947
33:54.940 --> 33:56.139
you want to know later,

948
33:56.180 --> 33:56.660
okay?

949
34:01.819 --> 34:02.299
Honey,

950
34:02.579 --> 34:03.700
I have things to do. Bye.

951
34:10.780 --> 34:12.219
Di Liren is holding back his anger.

952
34:12.300 --> 34:13.380
Stay at my place tonight.

953
34:13.900 --> 34:15.099
That's what I was thinking.

954
34:17.739 --> 34:19.059
Why did Harry suddenly

955
34:19.099 --> 34:20.059
show up in the stream?

956
34:20.500 --> 34:21.500
I have no idea.

957
34:23.940 --> 34:25.139
So it seems

958
34:25.780 --> 34:26.860
Harry really wasn't

959
34:26.900 --> 34:28.020
sent by Di Liren's side.

960
34:28.219 --> 34:29.900
Could it really just be a coincidence?

961
34:31.139 --> 34:32.059
Good heavens.

962
34:32.219 --> 34:33.380
Finally, you open your eyes.

963
34:34.619 --> 34:35.699
Oh, my.

964
34:36.420 --> 34:38.020
Now he's dragged into this too.

965
34:38.259 --> 34:39.460
As if it wasn't messy enough.

966
34:39.900 --> 34:41.460
You shouldn't worry tonight.

967
34:41.539 --> 34:42.659
Lu Hui and Di Liren should.

968
34:43.300 --> 34:44.179
The gears of fate

969
34:44.219 --> 34:45.259
have begun to turn.

970
34:45.739 --> 34:47.539
Who gets dragged in next

971
34:47.579 --> 34:48.340
is no longer

972
34:48.340 --> 34:49.059
under our control.

973
34:49.659 --> 34:50.300
You're right.

974
34:52.420 --> 34:53.780
If things don't go our way,

975
34:54.659 --> 34:55.980
we'll let nature take its course.

976
34:56.380 --> 34:56.780
Right.

977
34:57.020 --> 34:58.300
This has nothing to do with you.

978
34:58.500 --> 34:59.099
Let it go.

979
34:59.619 --> 35:00.020
Zi,

980
35:00.420 --> 35:01.579
how are the Jinghua samples?

981
35:02.059 --> 35:03.500
They're all with Liu Bai.

982
35:03.539 --> 35:05.288
Ready for testing tomorrow morning.

983
35:05.800 --> 35:06.820
Yes!

984
35:06.820 --> 35:07.380
Great.

985
35:24.699 --> 35:25.820
Why did you come back alone?

986
35:26.780 --> 35:27.619
Where's Haoyu?

987
35:29.139 --> 35:29.780
You know it?

988
35:30.099 --> 35:31.139
The second you saw him,

989
35:31.179 --> 35:32.139
you didn't call me.

990
35:32.780 --> 35:33.579
Now, you left him

991
35:33.619 --> 35:34.420
there all alone.

992
35:35.980 --> 35:36.780
Why don't you ask

993
35:36.820 --> 35:38.179
how he got into the stream today?

994
35:39.739 --> 35:40.860
Did you know all along?

995
35:41.139 --> 35:42.219
So what if I did?

996
35:42.659 --> 35:43.500
What could I say?

997
35:44.500 --> 35:45.739
All you care about right now

998
35:45.780 --> 35:46.659
is taking the company.

999
35:47.139 --> 35:48.099
Saying it won't help.

1000
35:48.340 --> 35:49.579
If you had told me sooner,

1001
35:49.980 --> 35:50.500
it could've

1002
35:50.539 --> 35:51.420
been avoided.

1003
35:51.860 --> 35:52.619
Do you know

1004
35:52.619 --> 35:53.579
how helpless I was?

1005
35:55.500 --> 35:56.460
Now you know

1006
35:57.340 --> 35:57.860
how I felt

1007
35:57.900 --> 35:58.860
when I heard

1008
35:58.900 --> 35:59.940
you were staying at Jiali.

1009
36:01.300 --> 36:02.579
What you love is power,

1010
36:02.820 --> 36:03.699
calling the shots,

1011
36:04.020 --> 36:04.900
and being in control,

1012
36:05.579 --> 36:06.699
not Haoyu and me.

1013
36:07.300 --> 36:09.059
I gave so much to Jiali.

1014
36:09.619 --> 36:10.539
I need to see results.

1015
36:10.579 --> 36:11.500
So even if it

1016
36:11.539 --> 36:13.020
puts Haoyu and me in danger,

1017
36:13.699 --> 36:14.579
you don't care?

1018
36:14.780 --> 36:16.179
Of course, I wouldn't put you two

1019
36:16.219 --> 36:17.259
in any danger.

1020
36:18.300 --> 36:19.300
I hope you mean that.

1021
36:20.659 --> 36:21.940
What did you say to Haoyu?

1022
36:25.259 --> 36:25.860
I

1023
36:26.739 --> 36:28.059
admitted that we're divorced.

1024
36:29.820 --> 36:30.980
Under those circumstances,

1025
36:31.380 --> 36:32.940
coming clean was the best choice.

1026
36:35.059 --> 36:35.460
Hui.

1027
36:35.739 --> 36:36.020
Hui.

1028
36:36.020 --> 36:36.780
Don't follow me!

1029
36:37.820 --> 36:38.900
Calm down first.

1030
36:39.259 --> 36:40.219
We need to work together

1031
36:40.820 --> 36:42.420
to keep up the act in front of Haoyu.

1032
36:44.900 --> 36:45.579
Listen to me,

1033
36:45.940 --> 36:46.380
okay?

1034
36:49.259 --> 36:49.980
Haoyu,

1035
36:51.820 --> 36:52.739
I shouldn't have kept

1036
36:53.780 --> 36:54.780
the divorce from you.

1037
36:58.500 --> 36:59.739
Did you enjoy lying to me?

1038
37:00.659 --> 37:01.900
You said he was on business.

1039
37:02.460 --> 37:03.099
What a lie.

1040
37:04.500 --> 37:04.940
There are

1041
37:04.980 --> 37:06.139
barely any of Dad's things,

1042
37:07.780 --> 37:08.860
so he moved out long ago,

1043
37:08.900 --> 37:09.259
right?

1044
37:17.539 --> 37:18.380
What you said before

1045
37:19.059 --> 37:20.500
about our family being reunited

1046
37:20.980 --> 37:21.699
was just an act.

1047
37:22.420 --> 37:23.579
But we love you.

1048
37:23.980 --> 37:24.619
Haoyu,

1049
37:25.179 --> 37:26.259
this is for your own good.

1050
37:28.460 --> 37:29.619
Can you just be honest?

1051
37:30.020 --> 37:31.139
When did you get divorced?

1052
37:31.619 --> 37:32.820
Before you went to the UK.

1053
37:33.539 --> 37:34.380
Why not tell me?

1054
37:38.300 --> 37:39.780
You were alone in a foreign country,

1055
37:40.300 --> 37:41.300
a stranger there.

1056
37:42.380 --> 37:44.300
We didn't want to burden you.

1057
37:45.699 --> 37:46.380
Haoyu,

1058
37:48.139 --> 37:49.420
it was an amicable split.

1059
37:49.780 --> 37:50.980
Even if we're not together,

1060
37:51.619 --> 37:52.940
we're still your parents,

1061
37:53.259 --> 37:54.300
and we still love you.

1062
37:55.659 --> 37:56.780
Could you please

1063
37:58.219 --> 37:59.460
try to understand us?

1064
38:00.420 --> 38:00.780
So...

1065
38:02.659 --> 38:03.340
What about Meng?

1066
38:04.099 --> 38:05.179
You dare bring her up?

1067
38:13.303 --> 38:16.424
(Han Guang)

1068
38:24.344 --> 38:27.252
(Han Guang)

1069
38:35.460 --> 38:36.539
Why did Yu Meng

1070
38:36.619 --> 38:37.619
suddenly send samples

1071
38:37.659 --> 38:38.420
in the livestream?

1072
38:38.900 --> 38:40.380
You know the samples have issues.

1073
38:41.780 --> 38:42.699
It was an ambush.

1074
38:44.259 --> 38:45.340
Don't worry about it.

1075
38:45.460 --> 38:46.380
Let her mess around.

1076
38:46.940 --> 38:48.539
Everything is under control.

1077
38:49.780 --> 38:50.659
Trust me.

1078
38:51.219 --> 38:53.139
I can handle whatever she throws at us.

1079
38:53.780 --> 38:55.739
Don't get so worked up.

1080
38:56.619 --> 38:57.340
Wait. But...

1081
38:57.820 --> 38:59.539
Yu Meng keeps blindsiding us.

1082
38:59.900 --> 39:01.619
Stop acting so relaxed.

1083
39:02.259 --> 39:04.020
Do you think I won't hit back?

1084
39:04.659 --> 39:05.420
What's your plan?

1085
39:05.460 --> 39:06.099
Let me hear it.

1086
39:17.179 --> 39:18.020
Starting tomorrow,

1087
39:18.739 --> 39:19.900
join the finance department.

1088
39:20.820 --> 39:21.860
Do what you need to do.

1089
39:25.900 --> 39:26.900
Dong Jun is gone.

1090
39:27.300 --> 39:28.820
Time to make room for someone new.

1091
39:31.579 --> 39:33.340
You not only counter every move,

1092
39:33.860 --> 39:35.099
you even plan ahead.

1093
39:43.752 --> 39:46.578
=The Vanishing Beauty= (Next Episode Preview)

1094
39:46.894 --> 39:47.139
(Lucky Beauty Yu)

1095
39:47.139 --> 39:47.940
(Lu Hui) Wait, that's not right.

1096
39:48.820 --> 39:49.699
Dad was dating Meng

1097
39:49.860 --> 39:51.179
before the divorce.

1098
39:52.219 --> 39:53.179
How about joining Jiali

1099
39:53.460 --> 39:54.460
and being my assistant?

1100
39:55.539 --> 39:56.179
Who are you?

1101
39:57.219 --> 39:58.219
We don't know each other.

1102
39:58.579 --> 39:59.860
But you should know me.

1103
40:00.860 --> 40:02.539
Every time you wired money to Di Liren,

1104
40:03.420 --> 40:05.179
that account ending in 304

1105
40:05.539 --> 40:06.300
was mine.

1106
40:08.259 --> 40:09.059
Police.

1107
40:09.699 --> 40:11.020
Three days in criminal detention.

1108
40:11.020 --> 40:12.179
Di Liren has pressed charges.

1109
40:12.780 --> 40:13.980
That fool!

1110
40:14.500 --> 40:16.099
I'm not just making the whole company

1111
40:16.179 --> 40:17.980
think she's crazy.

1112
40:18.579 --> 40:19.619
I want her to end up

1113
40:19.739 --> 40:21.179
with no one but me.

1114
40:36.516 --> 40:41.385
♪Old dreams have faded in color♪

1115
40:43.869 --> 40:48.732
♪A lonely heart torn in conflict♪

1116
40:51.190 --> 40:56.035
♪The love that stumbled along♪

1117
40:56.480 --> 41:02.982
♪Was just a quiet release♪

1118
41:05.714 --> 41:12.667
♪I write the future into a song, honoring the brave with no regrets♪

1119
41:13.217 --> 41:19.147
♪Turning all losses into the passion of this moment♪

1120
41:20.271 --> 41:27.502
♪I write the future into a song, for the me who never walks away♪

1121
41:27.805 --> 41:32.978
♪Forging all weaknesses into sharp, bold colors♪

1122
41:33.598 --> 41:45.066
♪In this life, I follow only my own choice♪

1123
41:47.566 --> 41:52.814
♪The chilled night has lost its color♪

1124
41:54.855 --> 42:00.290
♪No need to echo those who drifted apart♪

1125
42:02.112 --> 42:07.509
♪No longer proving my worth to anyone♪

1126
42:07.509 --> 42:16.154
♪The answer has long been etched in my silhouette♪

1127
42:16.630 --> 42:24.193
♪I write the future into a song, for the me who never walks away♪

1128
42:24.193 --> 42:30.039
♪Paving every twist and turn into a path forward♪

1129
42:30.039 --> 42:40.206
♪The ending of this life will be set by me♪
